WEBVTT

00:00:00.633 --> 00:00:13.092
Spaces is where your company keeps its pages: procedures, guides, plans and notes, for everyone to find. In this video, you’ll find a page, edit it, and see how pages stay trusted and tidy.

00:00:14.167 --> 00:00:23.105
Open Spaces. Pick a space at the top of the page tree: your own My Space first, then the spaces shared with the company. Here are the store procedures.

00:00:23.567 --> 00:00:29.881
Pages have headings, checklists, tables and images. This one walks the team through opening and closing.

00:00:30.333 --> 00:00:39.720
Click Edit page to change it in the rich editor. Every change is kept in the page’s version history, so you can see what changed and bring back an old version.

00:00:40.167 --> 00:00:45.095
New page or folder adds pages anywhere in the tree, or start one from a template.

00:00:45.533 --> 00:00:53.277
Important documents can go for approval, and an approved page is marked Verified. Ask Assist to sum up the page you’re reading.

00:00:53.733 --> 00:01:02.437
Out-of-date pages go to the Archive, where they stay searchable. Deleted pages wait in Docs trash, where your System Admin can bring them back.

